I want to make a running project of an F1 dashboard using FastF1 API. The initial modules I am considering are ghost sessions for qualifying, tyre degradation and tyre strategy used in race. What is the tech stack I need to do this and the entire project architecture. Suggest the tech stack in a way it looks modern, can handle seamless animation, professional grade and easy to integrate future modules. Give me timelines for each phase. \cf2 \cb4 I am thinking AWS for infrastructure, how much will this cost and what is the architecture?
\f1\fs24 \cf0 \cb1 \outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec5 \
