\cf0 \
Building a modern F1 dashboard with the 
\f2\b FastF1 API
\f1\b0  requires a stack that balances Python's heavy-duty data processing with a high-performance, smooth-animating frontend.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
Since FastF1 is Python-based, a 
\f2\b decoupled architecture
\f1\b0  is your best bet: a Python backend for data crunching and a modern JavaScript framework for the UI.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf6 \strokec6 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f3\fs36 \cf0 \strokec5 \uc0\u55356 \u57294 \u65039 
\f2\b  The Modern Tech Stack\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 To achieve "professional-grade" feel with "seamless animations," I recommend this stack for 2026:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

