\cf0 Building an F1 dashboard with 
\f2\b FastF1
\f1\b0  is a fantastic choice\'97the library is powerful, but it does have specific "quirks" regarding how it caches data and its processing time. To achieve a professional-grade, animated experience, you need to separate your 
\f2\b Data Processing
\f1\b0  from your 
\f2\b UI Rendering
\f1\b0 .\
