\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec5 Requirement:
\f1\b0  Compare two drivers' telemetry (Speed, Throttle, Brake) over a single lap.\
\ls16\ilvl0
\f2\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec5 Visual:
\f1\b0  A 2D track map where two "dots" (ghosts) move. A "Delta-Time" chart showing where one driver gains or loses time.\
\ls16\ilvl0
\f2\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec5 Key Logic:
\f1\b0  Use 
\f5\fs26 fastf1.telemetry.calculate_lap_data
\f1\fs24  to align laps by distance rather than time.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

